    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you gain the following benefits for 10 minutes or until you end them (no action required).</p><p><strong>Flight.</strong> You have a Fly Speed of 60 feet and can hover.</p><p><strong>Minor Wish.</strong> When you or an ally in your Aura of Protection fails a D20 Test, you can take a Reaction to make you or that ally succeed instead.</p><p>Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Long Rest, but you can restore it by expending a level 5 spell slot (no action required).</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
